==Points of Interest==
===Pokémon Appreciation Club===
Every day, a random unfused Pokémon is selected. Before completing [[Mt. Silver]], the chosen Pokémon cannot be a [[Legendary Pokémon|legendary]].

A Hiker will give the player a Nugget if they can show him a different Pokémon with the same type.

There are 3 Cool Trainers who will battle using a fusion of the chosen Pokémon. One of these will then trade their Pokémon for any fusion.

